{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14945","headline":"奉陪浑侍中上巳日泛渭河 · 卢纶","name":"奉陪浑侍中上巳日泛渭河","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青舸锦帆开，浮天接上台。\n晚莺和玉笛，春浪动金罍。\n舟檝方朝海，鲸鲵自曝腮。\n应怜似萍者，空逐榜人回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14945.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14945","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}